<http://data.silknow.org/object/76e36ca0-fa5d-3e27-80b7-773bd77129e8>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Natural colored linen; on this is worked with green, pink, light blue, yellow and white silk and a variety of stitches, a design of interlocking scrools bearing leaves, flowers and birds.  Through the middle are three medallions enclosing carnations in profile.  The main field is surrounded by a wide border and two narrow ones, in which are scrolling designs.  Edged with silk fringe and with tassels on two corners."@en ;
